   {
    "id": 1730986,
    "public_url": "jobs/python-developer-coffeebeans-consulting-1730986",
    "title": "Python Developer",
    "organization_id": 170918,
    "type": "jobs",
    "subtype": "jobs",
    "regn_open": 1,
    "updated_at": "2026-08-17T15:55:53+05:30",
    "region": "online",
    "visibility": "public",
    "details": "<p><strong>CoffeeBeans Consulting is hiring for Python Developer</strong></p>\n<p><strong>About the Company</strong></p>\n<p>CoffeeBeans Consulting is a dynamic and innovative consulting firm specializing in cutting-edge technology solutions. We are committed to delivering high-quality, scalable, and robust systems for our clients across various industries. Our team thrives on solving complex challenges and fostering a collaborative environment where creativity and technical excellence are highly valued.</p>\n<p><strong>Responsibilities</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Design, develop, and maintain robust backend systems using Python and FastAPI.</li>\n<li>Implement and manage enterprise multi-agent systems with a strong understanding of agent orchestration, memory, grounding, tool calling, and agent-to-agent communication.</li>\n<li>Build AI agents using Google ADK or similar frameworks (LangGraph, CrewAI, AutoGen).</li>\n<li>Integrate AI agents with existing enterprise systems and APIs, including MCP.</li>\n<li>Deploy and manage applications on Google Cloud Platform (GCP) using services like Cloud Run and Pub/Sub.</li>\n<li>Develop and maintain CI/CD pipelines using CircleCI and Terraform.</li>\n<li>Apply strong DevOps knowledge to ensure seamless deployment and operational efficiency.</li>\n<li>Utilize RAG, prompt engineering, grounding, and evaluation techniques to optimize agent performance.</li>\n<li>Collaborate with cross-functional teams to define, design, and ship new features.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>4-6 years of experience in backend development.</li>\n<li>Hands-on experience building enterprise multi-agent systems using Google ADK or similar frameworks.</li>\n<li>Strong understanding of agent orchestration, memory, grounding, tool calling, and agent-to-agent communication.</li>\n<li>Proficiency in Python development.</li>\n<li>Experience integrating agents with enterprise systems and APIs, including MCP.</li>\n<li>Experience with A2A Agents Framework.</li>\n<li>Understanding of RAG, prompt engineering, grounding, and evaluation.</li>\n<li>Experience deploying applications on GCP using Cloud Run, Pub/Sub, and CI/CD pipelines.</li>\n<li>Familiarity with GCP, FastAPI, CircleCI, and Terraform.</li>\n<li>Strong problem-solving skills and ability to work in a fast-paced environment.</li>\n</ul>",
    "short_id": "F26mVYy",
